### Determination of Mean Value and Systematic Error

The mean values reported for the ratios,(\(\frac{\pi^{-}}{\pi^{+}},\frac{K^{-}}{K^{+}},\frac{\bar{p}}{p}\)), were selected using the track sample having residuals as measured at the RICH pad plane of 0.9 cm in the bending and drift directions. The residual offers a measure on the track quality. A residual of

